  "new_claims": [
    {
      "local_id": "cl-1",
      "text": "章首标注时间为\"五百年后\"：孙悟空一个筋斗来到天庭，对这里景物有熟悉感，但他认为那一定是错觉，自认不记得自己到过天宫。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "五百年后"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-2",
      "text": "云海中走来一位紫衣女子，孙悟空上前称她\"女菩萨\"，问她到灵霄宝殿怎么走。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "请问到灵霄宝殿咋走"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-3",
      "text": "该紫衣女子自称\"我是紫霞\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0023/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0023"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我是紫霞。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-4",
      "text": "紫霞一指，云雾散开，孙悟空看见巨大的灵霄大殿，不知有多少重楼台，珍奇灵兽绕殿飞舞，殿侧云霞舒卷发出各色瑞气灵光。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "灵霄大殿就在那儿。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-5",
      "text": "紫霞对孙悟空说\"这么多年，你连话都一样\"，并直望着他不闪避目光；孙悟空自觉心虚，反问\"天宫的女孩子都这样么\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0023/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0023"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "这么多年，你连话都一样"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-6",
      "text": "紫霞望着孙悟空飞入大殿，忽然悠悠地叹了一声。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "却忽然悠悠地叹了一声"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-7",
      "text": "孙悟空一进殿，玉帝不由有些紧张。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "玉帝不由有些紧张"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-8",
      "text": "太上老君凑到玉帝耳边说，自己已在殿后安排了十万天兵与各路高手，并称孙悟空\"已经什么都不记得了\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0059/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0059"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我已在殿后安排了十万天兵"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-9",
      "text": "玉帝喝问孙悟空来此何事。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0012/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0012"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你来此何事啊"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-10",
      "text": "孙悟空问玉帝是否就是当年在黑暗中派人告知他\"要完成三件事，才能赎罪成正果\"的人，玉帝答\"是……是啊\"并暗自瞪太上老君。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0012/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0012"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "要完成三件事，才能赎罪成正果"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-11",
      "text": "孙悟空说取经人被人打死了，他想找回唐僧的魂魄，但地府说没有，只好到天庭来问。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "可是现在取经人被人打死了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-12",
      "text": "太上老君厉声指称\"唐僧分明是你打死的\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0059/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0059"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "唐僧分明是你打死的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-13",
      "text": "太上老君喝令\"传证人上殿\"，沙悟净从柱后走出。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "只见一人从柱后走了出来"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-14",
      "text": "孙悟空见到沙悟净后双目圆睁，怒道\"沙悟净！你敢诬告！\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "沙悟净！你敢诬告！"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-15",
      "text": "沙悟净否认是诬告，指证自己分明看见孙悟空与万灵之森女妖阿瑶勾结，谋害了师父。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0060/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0060"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我分明看你与万灵之森女妖阿瑶勾结"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-16",
      "text": "孙悟空听到\"阿瑶\"这个名字后有反应，重复道\"什么？阿瑶？这名字……\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "什么？阿瑶？这名字"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-17",
      "text": "太上老君称沙悟净是他派在取经队伍身边监视孙悟空等人的，并表示\"他说的话，我信\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0059/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0059"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "沙悟净是我派在你们身边监视你等的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-18",
      "text": "太上老君追加指控：孙悟空打入地府、打伤冥王、灭鬼卒十四万一千，片刻后又潜入龙宫杀死东海龙王敖广。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0059/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0059"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "灭鬼卒十四万一千"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-19",
      "text": "孙悟空称这些地方自己都去过，但这些事全未做过。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "但这些事我却全未做过"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-20",
      "text": "太上老君喝令拿下孙悟空，孙悟空擎棒在手，殿上诸天将无人敢上前。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "谁敢上前！"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-21",
      "text": "沙悟净跳到殿心与孙悟空恶斗；交手约二十回合后，孙悟空闪身到其右侧、挥棒直击后心，沙悟净匆忙以禅杖背挡，金箍棒将禅杖打得弯进去并击中其背，把他打得直飞出去。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "二人恶斗在一处"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-22",
      "text": "孙悟空正待再击时觉得头上金箍一紧，一股剧痛直潜入脑，他从空中直坠于地上。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "觉得头上金箍一紧"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-23",
      "text": "沙悟净爬起来跃回，飞起一脚将孙悟空踢得直飞出去，撞在一根巨柱上，连大殿也颤动了。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "将悟空踢得直飞出去"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-24",
      "text": "孙悟空在剧痛中单膝跪地、以金箍棒紧拄地面，竟将金箍棒直插入大殿地中一尺。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "直插入大殿地中一尺"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-25",
      "text": "孙悟空咬牙道\"好……你们……打的……好……\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你们……打的……好"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-26",
      "text": "沙悟净说\"金箍不允许你违抗天神，你输定了\"，随即又挥禅杖向孙悟空劈下。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0060/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0060"
      },
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "金箍不允许你违抗天神"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-27",
      "text": "孙悟空闪避但因疼痛速度大减，被沙悟净一杖劈中，大殿炸开一团光、玉砖碎片飞溅出天外。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "这一重击，可以碎山"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-28",
      "text": "尘烟散去后孙悟空仍站着，眼中充满怒火；他一直想看清是谁在念紧箍咒，但众神环绕、面孔漠然，他找不到。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "充满怒火"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-29",
      "text": "孙悟空抓住沙悟净脖颈，将他倒举起来掼在地上，栽进殿中半尺，巨大裂缝四下蔓延。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "将他倒举起来掼在地上"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-30",
      "text": "天兵蜂拥而上将孙悟空围在核心，他像发疯一般左冲右突、毫无章法地乱打乱劈；最后天兵退出老远围成圈，孙悟空仍独自疯狂舞动金箍棒，直到视线变暗、只剩疼痛和支撑他战斗的意识。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "孙悟空仍在独自疯狂舞动金箍棒"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-31",
      "text": "沙悟净、玉帝、太上老君、巨灵神与诸神将全都在圈外静静看着。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "全都在圈外静静看着"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-32",
      "text": "殿外围满十几万天兵；大战惊动九重天诸神，他们在远处云端议论，说天宫自上次大闹天宫之后多年没有这样闹过，并猜测被围者\"好像还是孙悟空\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "自从上回大闹天宫之后吧"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-33",
      "text": "紫霞立在一片云端，望着被围得铁桶似的宫殿，脸庞平静，看不出悲喜。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 18,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000018.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000018",
          "chapter_order": 18,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "紫霞立在一片云端"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    }
